Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:58:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] GPU: the frame line carries the card's memory, and slow
 submissions keep quiet
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A world run's frames ran over the card's budget (7,130 MB of 6,957) and the
line that says so came every six seconds, too seldom to line up with a frame;
it is on the frame line now with the texture copies refused for lack of room.
A slow submission printed a hundred pipeline names inside the path it timed,
164 times in one run: VICTORY_LOG_SLOW_PIPELINES=1 asks for them.

